# Gitignored files every workspace needs. Copied from the repository root directory.
#
# config/brief.json  - contacts.py and the orchestrator load this at startup; without
#                      it a fresh worktree hard-fails before the first stage runs.
# data/              - stage outputs from the last live run. Keeping them means an
#                      agent can re-run one stage (./run.sh --from contacts) instead
#                      of re-running discover and burning Firecrawl credits again.
#
# .venv/ is deliberately absent. Python bakes absolute paths into .venv/bin, so a
# copied venv points back at the root directory. scripts.setup rebuilds it instead.

config/brief.json
data/
